#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:1 a03ffdc4cf064e359f8213d5ae01d873
msgid "评测协议与指标"
msgstr "Evaluation Protocol and Metrics"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:3 fba1997a65074803bfec3f9d81c96606
msgid ""
"为了降低单次随机划分带来的方差与偏差，提供可复现的基准评估结果，UniKT 采用固定留出测试集结合训练池 5 折交叉验证，并汇报 5 "
"折均值与标准差。具体模型成绩可查阅[最新排行榜](live-leaderboard.md)与[论文基准排行榜（KDD "
"2027）](leaderboard.md)。"
msgstr ""
"To reduce single-split variance and provide reproducible benchmark "
"results, UniKT pairs a fixed hold-out test set with 5-fold "
"cross-validation on the training pool and reports the 5-fold mean and "
"standard deviation. Benchmark scores are available on the [Live "
"Leaderboard](live-leaderboard.md) and the [Benchmark Leaderboard (KDD "
"2027)](leaderboard.md)."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:5 fdfc81ab9c3b4edd8aef87ca9c965478
msgid "标准 5 折交叉验证"
msgstr "Standard 5-Fold Cross-Validation"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:7 e286407eb4c049768fc7de416ca6192b
msgid "学生级无泄露切分协议"
msgstr "Leak-Free Student-Level Splitting Protocol"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:9 715e7a603f4b4f15910bca2bc2fd1028
msgid "在知识追踪任务中，若直接对全部答题记录随机打乱切分，同一学生不同时段的记录会同时落入训练集与测试集，导致评估虚高。"
msgstr ""
"In knowledge tracing, shuffling individual interaction logs leaks "
"information across splits when records from the same student appear in "
"both training and test sets, artificially inflating performance."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:11 1ec624fa55454965ac1057c2b62c74f2
msgid ""
"UniKT 在固定随机种子下按学生随机切分（长序列切分均在划分后执行）：先按学生人数近似留出 **20%** 作为固定测试集（`fold = "
"-1`），再将剩余 **80%** 学生均匀划分为 5 折（`fold = 0..4`）。"
msgstr ""
"Under a fixed random seed, UniKT randomly partitions students (with "
"long-sequence chunking performed afterward): approximately **20%** by "
"student count are held out as a fixed test set (`fold = -1`), and the "
"remaining **80%** are divided evenly into 5 folds (`fold = 0..4`)."

