#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:49 ffe88c36ae814c41acb14c138928a831
msgid "**Test 集（20%）**：`fold = -1` 固定学生序列，5 折全程一致，不参与训练与早停。"
msgstr ""
"**Test Set (20%)**: Fixed student sequences with `fold = -1`, identical "
"across all 5 folds and excluded from training and early stopping."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:50 7d0de3715e554365862c40d14061e7f7
msgid "**Val 集（16%）**：第 `k` 折学生序列，用于早停监控（`patience = 10`）与最佳权重保存。"
msgstr ""
"**Val Set (16%)**: Student sequences in fold `k`, used for early stopping "
"(`patience = 10`) and best checkpoint selection."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:51 f6075610a2924a9c973032789715711f
msgid "**Train 集（64%）**：训练池其余 4 折学生序列，用于参数学习。"
msgstr ""
"**Train Set (64%)**: Remaining 4 training-pool folds of student sequences, "
"used for parameter updates."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:53 2b2189df26b847a69cfea9b10663cca2
msgid "使用辅助脚本 `run_kfold.sh`"
msgstr "Using Helper Script `run_kfold.sh`"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:55 d82ec8a68825436cb671b5dc6feeca79
msgid "UniKT 在 `scripts/run_kfold.sh` 中提供了多折连续执行脚本，支持训练参数透传与多折自动化串联。"
msgstr ""
"UniKT provides `scripts/run_kfold.sh` for consecutive multi-fold "
"execution, supporting argument forwarding and automated multi-fold "
"chaining."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:57 9d40fa3bb1c145c49f2bcb4331f6fc2a
msgid "A. 查看所有支持的模型列表"
msgstr "A. List All Supported Models"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:59 efb5cade37354a309f2fe1a8a27ef53e
msgid "使用 `-l` 或 `--list` 选项列出当前代码库中所有已支持的模型："
msgstr "Use `-l` or `--list` to list all supported models in the current codebase:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:61 1d7360f4185044ec9b93595382c10527
msgid "bash scripts/run_kfold.sh -l\n"
msgstr "bash scripts/run_kfold.sh -l\n"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:65 8cb6791414c2497d93de5925784c4157
msgid "B. 运行单模型的 5 折交叉验证"
msgstr "B. Run 5-Fold Cross-Validation for a Single Model"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:67 2c0b759e6f7f4043a8921a6a060bfe87
msgid "向脚本传入模型名称、折索引列表及待透传的训练参数："
msgstr ""
"Pass the model name, fold index list, and training hyperparameters to the"
" script:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:69 26886567e9c94fea915f7e012ed90581
msgid ""
"bash scripts/run_kfold.sh GIKT \"0 1 2 3 4\" -d assistments09 "
"--model.epochs 150 --model.batch_size 128\n"
msgstr ""
"bash scripts/run_kfold.sh GIKT \"0 1 2 3 4\" -d assistments09 "
"--model.epochs 150 --model.batch_size 128\n"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:73 c6ed9a9ca481465fb45041816e118fa2
msgid ""
"支持空格分隔（`\"0 1 2 3 4\"`）或逗号分隔（`\"0,1,2,3,4\"`）。脚本将依次启动第 0 至第 4 "
"折的训练任务。若某折执行失败（Exit code $\\neq$ 0），脚本将立即中断并保留错误现场，避免无意义的算力消耗。"
msgstr ""
"Supports space-separated (`\"0 1 2 3 4\"`) or comma-separated "
"(`\"0,1,2,3,4\"`) strings. The script launches fold 0 through fold 4 "
"sequentially. If any fold fails (Exit code $\\neq$ 0), execution "
"terminates immediately to preserve error state and save compute "
"resources."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:75 85d4cbdd409c44a9a524d1840f8922cc
msgid "C. 运行特定子集折"
msgstr "C. Run a Subset of Folds"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:77 aaa143ddf9cf435abd86e0bd11964814
msgid "若某次训练在某几折中断，或只需在特定折验证："
msgstr ""
"If training was interrupted on specific folds, or if only a subset "
"requires validation:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:79 e01fcd95c47b43d1bda176fa9014f55f
msgid ""
"# 仅执行第 0 折和第 2 折\n"
"bash scripts/run_kfold.sh GIKT \"0 2\" -d assistments09 --model.epochs "
"100\n"
msgstr ""
"# Execute only fold 0 and fold 2\n"
"bash scripts/run_kfold.sh GIKT \"0 2\" -d assistments09 --model.epochs "
"100\n"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:84 caf6bc9cb9524ccb8b5c41a9a1cee25c
msgid "D. 原生命令行手动执行"
msgstr "D. Manual Invocation via Native CLI"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:86 0582fd629ef348839117db9eba3891c5
msgid "如果不使用 bash 脚本，也可以直接在终端通过原生循环调用 `train.py`："
msgstr ""
"Without the bash helper, you can directly run a native loop calling "
"`train.py` in the terminal:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:88 2fd2280bc2924f40a75de4096cbefec2
msgid ""
"for fold in 0 1 2 3 4; do\n"
"  python train.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 --data.fold $fold "
"--model.epochs 150 --model.batch_size 128\n"
"done\n"
msgstr ""
"for fold in 0 1 2 3 4; do\n"
"  python train.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 --data.fold $fold "
"--model.epochs 150 --model.batch_size 128\n"
"done\n"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:94 e5b9c42af3394c9ebdc9575c62063897
msgid "5 折结果汇总与统计指标"
msgstr "5-Fold Aggregation and Summary Statistics"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:96 ead71631ac9b4fc18cc87d014e408027
msgid "完成 5 折训练后，`runs/normal/` 目录下将产生 5 个独立的实验子目录："
msgstr ""
"After completing 5-fold training, 5 distinct experiment subdirectories "
"are generated in `runs/normal/`:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:98 b7588355fdeb433cbb31061e8be37ff7
msgid ""
"runs/normal/\n"
"├── GIKT_assistments09_20261109-100000_fold0_bs128/\n"
"├── GIKT_assistments09_20261109-102500_fold1_bs128/\n"
"├── GIKT_assistments09_20261109-105000_fold2_bs128/\n"
"├── GIKT_assistments09_20261109-111500_fold3_bs128/\n"
"└── GIKT_assistments09_20261109-114000_fold4_bs128/\n"
msgstr ""
"runs/normal/\n"
"├── GIKT_assistments09_20261109-100000_fold0_bs128/\n"
"├── GIKT_assistments09_20261109-102500_fold1_bs128/\n"
"├── GIKT_assistments09_20261109-105000_fold2_bs128/\n"
"├── GIKT_assistments09_20261109-111500_fold3_bs128/\n"
"└── GIKT_assistments09_20261109-114000_fold4_bs128/\n"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:107 2e8c0ed40fbd4f2ab3d8d18e389db0f7
msgid "每个运行目录下的 `metrics_test.csv` 均记录了该折在测试集上的最终评测指标。可以使用如下代码按折去重取最新结果并计算 5 折均值与标准差："
msgstr ""
"Each run directory contains a `metrics_test.csv` file recording final "
"test set evaluation metrics. Use the snippet below to pick the latest run "
"per fold and compute 5-fold mean and standard deviation:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:109 e71be30ee06e4973a08b5e030ee2b31a
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"import glob\n"
"import pandas as pd\n"
"\n"
"# 0..4 每折选取最新的测试指标文件，避免重跑同一折时重复计入\n"
"metrics_files = []\n"
"for fold in range(5):\n"
"    candidates = sorted(\n"
"        glob.glob(f\"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_*_fold{fold}_bs128/metrics_test.csv\")\n"
"    )\n"
"    if not candidates:\n"
"        raise FileNotFoundError(f\"Missing metrics_test.csv for fold {fold}\")\n"
"    metrics_files.append(candidates[-1])\n"
"\n"
"dfs = [pd.read_csv(f) for f in metrics_files]\n"
"summary = pd.concat(dfs, ignore_index=True)\n"
"assert len(summary) == 5, f\"Expected 5 folds, got {len(summary)}\"\n"
"\n"
"print(\"=== 5 折交叉验证测试集统计 ===\")\n"
"print(f\"有效折数: {len(summary)}\")\n"
"for metric in [\"auc\", \"acc\", \"rmse\"]:\n"
"    if metric in summary.columns:\n"
"        mean_val = summary[metric].mean()\n"
"        std_val = summary[metric].std()\n"
"        print(f\"{metric.upper():<6}: {mean_val:.4f} ± {std_val:.4f}\")\n"
msgstr ""
"import glob\n"
"import pandas as pd\n"
"\n"
"# Pick the latest test metrics file per fold (0..4) to avoid duplicates on re-runs\n"
"metrics_files = []\n"
"for fold in range(5):\n"
"    candidates = sorted(\n"
"        glob.glob(f\"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_*_fold{fold}_bs128/metrics_test.csv\")\n"
"    )\n"
"    if not candidates:\n"
"        raise FileNotFoundError(f\"Missing metrics_test.csv for fold {fold}\")\n"
"    metrics_files.append(candidates[-1])\n"
"\n"
"dfs = [pd.read_csv(f) for f in metrics_files]\n"
"summary = pd.concat(dfs, ignore_index=True)\n"
"assert len(summary) == 5, f\"Expected 5 folds, got {len(summary)}\"\n"
"\n"
"print(\"=== 5-Fold Cross-Validation Test Set Statistics ===\")\n"
"print(f\"Valid Folds: {len(summary)}\")\n"
"for metric in [\"auc\", \"acc\", \"rmse\"]:\n"
"    if metric in summary.columns:\n"
"        mean_val = summary[metric].mean()\n"
"        std_val = summary[metric].std()\n"
"        print(f\"{metric.upper():<6}: {mean_val:.4f} ± {std_val:.4f}\")\n"

